  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Project in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote sanitation in the public space in Kakuma (Turkana West Sub -County, Turkana County), Oxfam constructed a bio -sanitation ablution block which is a pay -and -use facility in Kakuma Town Market.This involves installation of a cooking gas and all associated accessories within the facility.</narrative>
  </description>
